{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2022-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1664582400, "end_date": 1665273599, "month_true_total": 1760, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:24:47 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "123561251", "author": {"steamid": "76561198268947584", "personaname": "✪ Cthulhu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cthulhuthegood/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 22365, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9428, "last_played": 1773451705, "avatar": "10c4697efbd32f5853bfaffb959fc28140c344e8"}, "language": "english", "review": "ROCK N STONE", "timestamp_created": 1665272958, "timestamp_updated": 1665272958, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123561200", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162365499", "personaname": "Solarson", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheCoolerSolarson/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 18880, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17825, "last_played": 1747364878, "avatar": "ffdf40a8978b112b4c8b815978091aaa460613f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Deep Rock Galactic is the perfect example of what a good and customer-friendly developer should do.\n\nWhen you boot it up you might get turned away from the battlepass, but worry not because they are entirely free. Old rewards are thrown into random loot tables, and more recently they added the ability to play through old passes if the RNG isn't doing it for you.\n\nEvery major update comes with a paid cosmetic DLC and plenty more free cosmetics, and them being free doesn't mean they look any less good. Most importantly NONE of the DLC features actual gameplay, its all cosmetics, so a new player won't have to worry about having to pay real money for a new gun.\n\nThe game is also just plain fun. I wouldn't have put nearly 300 hours into this on a PC that could barely run it if I didn't like it. Shooting feels nice, each of the 4 classes are highly customizable and distinct, while also being self-sufficient enough so that any mission can be completed with a 4-stack. The gameplay loop is surprisingly engaging despite it all being randomly generated, and of course this community is probably the single friendliest in the gaming sphere.\n\nMasterclass, 10/10, I should buy the DLC just to give the devs more of my money.", "timestamp_created": 1665272835, "timestamp_updated": 1729724785, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500353038311004639", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123560664", "author": {"steamid": "76561198975984159", "personaname": "Johnny Bravo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198975984159/", "num_games_owned": 336, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2530, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 281, "last_played": 1745951931, "avatar": "00a7ce409dafd08c020961de50dd24141dc84da6"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is great but it's even better when you play with friends. interesting and I like that there are a lot of games in the lobby and you can get drunk and throw things. Robots are funny and you can laugh a lot when you play it. I like that the game has DLS. You can upgrade guns, equipment, yourself and you can change the appearance of your character. The game is great and I would recommend it to everyone.", "timestamp_created": 1665271674, "timestamp_updated": 1665271674, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123559106", "author": {"steamid": "76561198840170769", "personaname": "BakePotato45", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JuniorM14/", "num_games_owned": 225, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5732, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5251, "last_played": 1727563878, "avatar": "0e96fd1da4c91017a7c1de980d6361b139e6831d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its so fun when playing with friends and the soundtrack is fantastic", "timestamp_created": 1665268714, "timestamp_updated": 1665268714, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123558737", "author": {"steamid": "76561198259725527", "personaname": "MeatRock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198259725527/", "num_games_owned": 345, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 52007, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 36619, "last_played": 1768098564, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just buy it already", "timestamp_created": 1665268064, "timestamp_updated": 1665268064, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false,